        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"8"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_66981_Option_8|原来是这样吗，那么所有人都是这样的？包括那些扭曲的、疯狂的人？",
