      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_66981_Content_11|你很敏锐，守密人，这也是为什么我一直尽量减少与世间接触的原因之一。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_66981_Content_12|当我游离于世界之外，不与人类保持过于紧密的联系，我就会保持思维的清醒与独立。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_66981_Content_13|就像如果我不曾品尝蛋糕的甜美，我就不会在思绪中常常产生对它的偏爱。"
