        ContactRole = {1920},
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_1|好神奇的盒子，恩人，这真的不是用某种魔法或仪式阵驱动的吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"2"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_2|不是",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_2|不是，这是纯正的银芯科技，另外提醒你一句，通讯器的造价昂贵，建议你不要随意拆卸哦。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_3|啊，真是可惜……恩人怎么知道我正想把它拆掉的？这是读心术吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"4"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_4|也不是……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_4|也不是……猜你的想法连心理学都用不上吧！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_5|想必心理学又是一门高深的知识了，惭愧，我所知晓实在贫瘠……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_6|恩人，学会这门银芯科技与心理学都需要多长时间呢？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"7"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_7|学会？嗯……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_7|学会？嗯……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_8|入门需要四五年，学会恐怕要钻研一辈子吧。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_9|一辈子！难道这些知识竟有数千本经卷这样多吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        NextChatID = {"10"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_10|那倒也不是……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_10|那倒也不是，只是这两门学科现在也都在发展之中，有许许多多的学者会将这些研究拓宽、拓深，创造出新的知识来。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_11|如果你将这样蓬勃发展的学科当作学习目标，当然要活到老学到老啦。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_12|原来如此，会不断发展的知识……真是伟大啊。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_13|我们研习提灯的经文时，甚至不可篡改一字，所有的内容都被大家固定、重复，恒久不变。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_14|但，每每学习经文时，都会有一种身处盒中，一眼望到尽头的憋闷感。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_15|果然，只有不断生长的知识，才符合生命的真谛！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"16"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_16|突然好升华……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_16|突然好升华……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_17|说到这里，我有一个绝佳的学习机会可以免费赠予你。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_18|真的吗恩人！感激之情，难以言表。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"19"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Option_19|当然是真的。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81325_Content_19|当然是真的，这本银芯技术使用与维修原理练习，与这本调查员心理策略必修手册，你想先写……"
      }),
      readonly({
