        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_4|但我最近阅读的书籍又提到，让他人替自己完成作业，貌似是一种不道德的行为。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Emoji = 46747
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"6", "7"},
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_6|那么，如何判断这件事究竟是否道德呢？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"8"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_7|呃……这个事吧，你要辩证地看。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_7|呃……这个事吧，你要辩证地看。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"8"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_8|我们不能说绝对的是，也不能说绝对的否。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_8|我们不能说绝对的是，也不能说绝对的否。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_9|判断一件事，不能只从结果来看，更要从行动的目的来看。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_10|恩人是说……要看做这件事时的想法？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        NextChatID = {"11"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_11|没错。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_11|没错，你想啊，我让你写那两份作业，究竟是想要剥削你为我免费工作，还是希望你获得学习的机会呢？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_12|我不知道。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"13"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_13|这怎么会不知道呢？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_13|这怎么会不知道呢？当然是为了让你能够更好地学习知识！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_14|原来是这样，是我误会了，我还以为恩人只是想让我帮您完成作业呢。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"15"},
        Emoji = 46775
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_16|咳咳……好了，你再想一想，我们做一件事时，如果将人作为行动本身的目的，真心为对方考虑，这样可以称作道德。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_17|如果将人当作纯粹的工具，这当然就是不道德的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1920},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_18|我好像懂了，就像提灯将我和波吕克斯当作祭祀的工具，而不是真心考虑我们的感受，这样就是不道德的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"19"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_19|没错没错，你的悟性很好！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_19|没错没错，你的悟性很好！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_20|我明白了，恩人真是一个很有道德的人！那么，请恩人再给我几本作业吧，我会认真做完再来请教的！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_21|恩人？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "21",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Option_22|那个，我忽然有点事……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_81324_Content_22|那个，我忽然有点事，作业的事你还是直接去找朵尔吧！"
      })
    })
  },
  [94501] = {
    ID = 94501,
    CnID = "通讯@波吕克斯日常1",
    BaseSortID = 192,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 192,
        Trigger = 1,
        Ascription = 1922,
        Awaker = 77917,
        UnlockTime = 946674000,
        ContactRole = {1922},
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_1|尊敬的大人，感谢您为我和卡斯托尔费心准备的屋舍。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_2|我听到卡斯托尔说屋舍中被特意增添了一张床铺，就知道一定是您的手笔。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_3|我们从小在教会中就习惯于一同在寝宫中起居，听闻此地的寝居规定为一人一间后还略有忧心。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_4|如今看到您心细如发地为我们考量，实在发觉当日泰旖丝女士建议我们投奔于您的正确。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"5"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Option_5|小事小事。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_5|哈哈，小事小事，你们来这里之后住得还习惯吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_6|承蒙照拂，一切都好，此地的寝宫虽然狭小如侍女的屋舍，但陈设用品都很齐全，适应之后也颇有温馨之感。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"7"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Option_7|啊哈哈，是吗，那就好，那就好……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_7|啊哈哈，是吗，那就好，那就好……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1922},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_8|我们已经慢慢学会在无人服侍下生活，您不用为我们担心，不如说这是我们两个多年来梦寐以求的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_9|尤其是屋内配备的洁面膏真是神奇，按照说明使用后竟能产生许多云朵般的泡沫，那份洁牙膏的味道也十分清新。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_10|卡斯托尔那个家伙喜欢得一天要洗漱五次，被我拦下后变成了一天三次。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"11"},
        Emoji = 46775
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_12|洗太多次脸会坏掉的啊！！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_13|不过你们之前都没有用过这些东西吗？没想到提灯教会居然这么小气。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_14|的确没有，不过并非因为教会小气，而是我们身为圣子，一直以来都被要求节制欲望、潜心修行。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_15|我们几乎从未接触过这些科技制品，每日的起居、饮食亦有许多规定。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_16|虽说衣着饮食上大都足够奢华，但除却三餐时间是不能进食的，到达起床时间后更是必需离开寝宫。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_17|小时候我就常常幻想着什么时候可以不用早起，一整天都能想吃什么就吃什么。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_18|这几天我已经屡次在下午看到一位少女端着食物从走廊经过，看起来我那梦想中的生活在这里已经是日常了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"19"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Option_19|啊，那大概是墨菲去拿小蛋糕了吧……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_19|啊，那大概是墨菲去拿小蛋糕了吧……你们的生活还真是辛苦啊。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_20|一切都过去了，那些错误和扭曲都会留在过去，我们会以崭新的姿态走上正确的道路，请您见证。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Option_21|太客气了。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94501_Content_21|太客气了，有问题找我就好，你们这样的态度已经比有些唤醒体不知道省心多少倍了！"
      })
    })
  },
  [94502] = {
    ID = 94502,
    CnID = "通讯@波吕克斯日常2",
    BaseSortID = 193,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 193,
