      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_2|自从您建议我们去多多结交朋友，我和卡斯托尔就常常前往那些热闹之处徘徊。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"3"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Option_3|徘徊？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_3|徘徊？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_4|没错，我们常常在餐厅或是广场静坐，观察过往的人流，尽量不打扰大家。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"5"},
        Emoji = 46788
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_6|呃，虽然你们的出发点是好的，但是傻坐在原地是没办法交朋友的啊！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_7|原来是这样么，是我们囿于礼教了，不过没想到这里居然有一位真正的骑士！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_8|您或许听卡斯托尔说过，我们两人一直十分崇拜骑士的故事。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_9|那天在广场，我们看到一位手持长枪的少年，正与一位女士讨论骑士的枪法。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"10"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Option_10|哦！应该是奥吉尔和萝坦吧。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_10|哦！应该是奥吉尔和萝坦吧。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_11|奥吉尔……这个名字我记下了，那位少年的气度正直英勇，令我们心驰神往，我和卡斯托尔原本想要上前，他们却很快路过离开了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_12|回到寝室后，我们辗转反侧，实在想要结识那位骑士，却不知如何开口，故来请求您的引荐，希望您能够拨冗费心，促成我们的会面。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        NextChatID = {"13"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Option_13|其实你们不需要这么客气。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_13|我听明白了，其实你们不需要这么客气，奥吉尔是个很热心的人，只要你们开口，他一定很乐意和你们交朋友的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_14|不愧是真正的骑士，这份胸怀真令人钦佩，竟然愿意接受陌生的、曾为敌人效力的我们。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        NextChatID = {"15"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Option_15|这和胸怀没什么关系吧！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_15|不不，这和胸怀没什么关系吧！这就是正常人交朋友的样子啊！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_16|虽说不是每个唤醒体都是正常人……但这里大部分人还都是很友好的，你们大胆地正常交际就好。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_17|抱歉，请您赐教，什么叫做……正常的交际？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"18"},
        Emoji = 46742
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_19|我懂了，就让我来告诉你们交友的秘诀吧！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_20|那就是主动！真诚与主动是最打动人的！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_21|要记住，你们可能会被拒绝、被欺骗，但那是伤害你们的人的问题，永远不要怀疑真诚是错的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "21",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_22|锻炼一颗坚强的心，然后勇敢地去体验友谊吧！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "22",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_94502_Content_23|您的智慧每一次都使我崇敬赞叹，我会好好体悟您的教诲，由衷感谢您，我的明灯。"
      })
    })
  },
