  [127001] = {
    ID = 127001,
    CnID = "通讯@缸中之脑终极法则",
    BaseSortID = 214,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 214,
        Trigger = 2,
        Ascription = 1120,
        Awaker = 15570,
        RequireTaskComplete = {127100},
        UnlockTime = 946674000,
        ContactRole = {1120},
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_1|以下消息为定时发送",
        ExtraReward = {25218, 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_2|守密人，虽然当前行为或许会被普世认知定义为“危险”，但相信你还没有愚蠢到认为我会说一些煽情的废话与叮嘱。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_3|我认为对于如今的你来说，那些多余的话语已经并无必要。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_4|你已经以远超于我预期的速度，成长为了足够成熟坚强的个体，也自然会明白，每个人都有一生中需要去追求的东西，这是他人无法参与的命题。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_5|我想要知晓世界的本质，知晓越过阴暗寂灭的荒芜后，理性的光辉是否仍然闪耀于黑暗之中，知晓一切穷极的尽头，世间万物是否拥有共同的起点。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_6|为此，我会对我的躯体和颅脑进行最终的改良，尝试跨越居于极值之外的界限。介于这有概率是我们最后一次交流，我选择用你能理解的方式传达我的感受。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_7|谢谢你带给我的这份礼物，我将用它去追寻答案，并期待人类智识能从彼方带来全新的引领。愿银钥指引我们。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"9", "10"},
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_8|朵尔老师！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"11"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Option_9|太冒险了",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_9|太冒险了！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        NextChatID = {"11"},
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Option_10|再等等",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_10|再等等！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_11|怎么今天就？！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_12|这样太冒险了，也许我们该等到学院提供更多帮助。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_13|那是今天凌晨2点，我在实验开始前，设置的定时发送。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "Thinking"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_14|希望你没对着通讯器露出任何失态的蠢表情，如果有，在来实验室见我之前整理好。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_15|我？去实验室吗？现在？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "Thinking"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_16|没错，某种程度上，我确实感知到了那件我所追寻之物的真相。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_17|等等，该不会和那个「朵尔」一样……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_18|不，一切的尽头，并不像她所理解的一样是「毁灭」，恰恰相反，是「开始」。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_19|「真理」并非固定有形的静态存在，在越过那条界限之后，理性和智识能够引领人类将其锚定，永恒不移地行进。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_127001_Content_20|所以，我会制订更加完善、精准的训练与提高计划，以确保你离歧路更远，能够更好地追寻你的命题。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "21",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
