        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_1|守密人。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Option_2|怎么了？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_2|怎么了？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1157,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_3|你认为……什么样的命运，才称得上公正与正确？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_4|公正与正确？……大概是尽可能维护大多数人的利益吧。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1157,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_5|那如果——注定要牺牲少数人的利益呢？您认可这样的命运走向，是么？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_6|你……为什么突然问这个？不要误会我的意思啊！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_7|要是你又要做什么毁灭哪个世界的事情，还请多想一想啊阿拉克涅！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1157},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_8|不必担忧，守密人，只是跑步比赛而已。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_9|呼……吓我一跳……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_10|不过你有那么多条腿，参加跑步比赛是不是有些不太公平……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1157},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_11|卡斯托尔拥有翅膀，诺缔拉也带上了她的载具。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1157},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_12|我平日都在剧院纺织，并不擅于运动。不过，我已经替我的侍女报了名。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_13|很难想象，你为什么会对这种事情感兴趣？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1157,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_14|看着人们为了一个目标而展露出蓬勃的生机与坚韧的意志，是一件令人愉悦的事情。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1157,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_15|以及……我有些好奇，那块作为奖品的蛋糕究竟有什么样的魔力，能让塔薇也沉迷其中。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_16|只要不是什么什么毁掉一个世界的选择题，怎样都好……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_17|呃，你是不会用命运丝线操控比赛结果的，对吧？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_137645_Content_18|……阿拉克涅？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
