      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Option_3|法洛思……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_3|法洛思……唉，这时候说能理解你也是空虚的安慰，你……别太难过了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1162},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_4|忧愁……思乡的忧愁已成为灵魂中的烙印，我已习惯和它共存。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1162},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_5|不断思念带来痛苦，也会让我永远记得故乡的模样。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1162,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_6|那些珊瑚丛生的浅滩，那座巍峨的神殿，与我常常伫立看守的高耸大门……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1162,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_7|我记得那些石柱边缘雕刻的纹路，记得王都中每一条宽阔的道路，记得人们祈祷时虔诚幸福的表情。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1162,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_8|举行大型祭典时，举国同庆，那是我最忙碌也最满足的时刻。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1162},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_9|我曾有幸守护在王驾之前，一同享受万民瞻仰崇敬的眼神，感到自豪而荣耀……那是我最怀念的时刻。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Option_10|那一定是个很美的国家。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_10|只是听你的描述，我也能感觉到，那一定是个很美的国家。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1162},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_11|是的，故乡很美……所以我不会放弃找回它。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1162},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_12|更强大的力量，代表更多的希望，我会引诱更多的飞蛾向着灯塔的方向前进……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1162,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_13|总有一天，故国会从海底重新升起，向我重新敞开它的怀抱。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Option_14|结果还是要做这种事啊！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134105_Content_14|结果还是要做这种事啊！简直白悲伤了，给我住手！！！"
      })
    })
  },
