      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2225,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_12|哎呀，让妾身想想。这时候告诉小茉莉花，妾身原本只想养些蛐蛐来斗，岂不是很煞风景？"
