      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2225,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_14|这世间实在太无聊了，%player%。即使明日就要迎来消亡，庸人们还是囿于那些怨啊，爱啊，憎啊，欲啊的俗物。"
