      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_15|……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {2225},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_16|然而就算这样，妾身的小茉莉花也勤勤恳恳，张牙舞爪地给祂们想着办法。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {2225},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_17|所以，既然妾身已经获得了这般伟力，以后是要给我最爱的小茉莉花帮些忙，还是添些堵呢？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2225,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_18|果然，还是同时做两件事最有趣，对吧？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Option_19|？？？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_19|？？？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_20|送你礼物不是让你做这个的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "21",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134104_Content_21|快停手，我只负责融蚀事件，公序良俗不归弥萨格管，不要让伦蒂尼恩的精神病院代替监狱啊，喂，喂！"
      })
    })
  },
