        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_9|哈？那我还欠了乔一只鸡腿，欠小琼斯两块面包，偷过强尼几颗弹珠呢……他们不会是来讨债的吧！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1553,
          nil,
          "Shy2"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_10|不过，我没有从那些小眼睛里感到恶意，相反，我安心极了，而且我现在好像能和它们融为一体。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Option_11|你和它们的感官融合了？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_11|你是说，你融合进了老鼠们的灵魂？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1553},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_12|对，我感到我一瞬间分散成了很多很多份，在弯弯曲曲的管道、脏乱的杂物、低矮的家具下窜行……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Option_13|都过去了",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_13|你是不是想到从前的生活了，没关系，现在一切都过去了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1553,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_14|然后——控制它们轻松偷到各种东西！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1553,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_15|当年我要是有这种本事，甚至能把西区最大的银行都搬空，哈哈哈，现在我简直是全国……不，全世界的盗王之王！再也没有人能阻拦我了！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1553,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Emoji = 97390
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Option_17|……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134109_Content_17|感觉这回连报警都没用了，我还是向朵尔老师申请制作一个监控器吧。"
      })
    })
  },
  [134110] = {
