      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_4|不，不，更多@2人的技术，知识，更强大的灵魂，都没有用，没有用了！我还是没办法再迁徙！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_5|变强之后反而更容易被黑色看见了，太显眼了，会被黑色追上的……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_6|我不要变强了，我要逃，我要跑得远远的，但如果整个世界都是黑的，所有的光都是假的，那我能去哪里……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_7|为什么，为什么这份力量会让我看到这些，我不想知道！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_8|要死要死要死又要死一次了吗，我不要再经历，我不想我不想……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Option_9|温柯尔！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_9|醒醒，温柯尔！世界没有变成黑的，我还在这里！大家都在这里！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_10|没有……吗？黑色的恶魔没有来吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_11|但，如果我们住在恶魔的肚子里，那总会有被黑暗吞噬的一天，我们逃不掉，逃不掉的啊！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134110_Content_12|这太可怕，太可怕了……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Emoji = 46746
      }),
      readonly({
