      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1168},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_4|它从未如此清晰……它从未如此……平凡……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Option_5|平凡？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_5|弥利亚姆……你确定这是你说出来的话吗……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_6|我看见我的故土。我看见那永生不灭的未来。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_7|但更多的……我看见现在。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1168},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_8|吾主，亲眷，挚友，信众……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1168},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134115_Content_9|神国一直都在身边……我所拥有的，一直都是神国的一部分……"
