        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_2|你一定也听见了吧？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_3|它在邀请我们，他们在等待我们……一起前往海底纯白的宫殿。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Option_4|我没有。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_4|谁？我怕是耳朵聋了，什么都没听见。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_5|那么，这就是独属于我的缪斯之吻了，海洋的美，如今已与我的灵魂相融。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1169,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_6|你总是会给我带来更多创作的灵感，我真是越来越喜欢你了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1169,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_7|要不要考虑当我的长期助手？你什么都不用做，只需要每天来我的工作室小坐一会儿，喝一杯茶，聊一聊天。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Option_8|我会被做成雕塑吗？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_8|虽然很荣幸受到你的厚爱，但……我会不会一觉醒来变成一块石雕？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_9|呵呵，你竟然是这样看待我的吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_10|是罗杰斯那种粗暴的行为给你留下了阴影，还是说，你认为我是这样贫瘠而懒惰的艺术家？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_11|磨练创作的技艺不能绕行任何捷径，我的雕塑，自然都是由我一刀一刀雕刻而成。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_12|放心好了，不会用到你一根头发丝的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Option_13|你的手艺太好了。",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_13|哈哈……可能是你的雕塑技艺太好了，每次看到你的作品都有一种看到活人的错觉。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_14|嗯……那么，现在我的力量达到极致后，说不定真的可以做出能活过来的雕塑哦。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1169,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_15|夜深人静的时刻，在你的视线之外，雕塑的眼球会缓缓转动，嘴角会微微翘起……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1169,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_16|等我做完最新的作品，就送一座放到你的床头，替我好好看着你，怎么样？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Option_17|不要啊！！！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_17|我会这辈子都不敢睡觉的！！！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_18|骗你的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1169},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134181_Content_19|看来，你是真的很害怕这样简单的鬼故事，真是可爱。"
      })
    })
  },
