      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_2|我消化了很久很久，它们……现在让我觉得我好像重新变得完整了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Option_3|你的记忆力变好了？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_3|也就是说，你现在不会忘记事情了？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_4|嗯，让我想想……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_5|哈哈，还是记不住！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_6|为什么是这么骄傲的语气啊！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_7|因为，虽然可能还是会忘掉很多事情，但过去和现在，%player%都会一直提醒我，帮我记住。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_8|我是谁，我在哪，我要做什么，会由我最信任的人们告诉我。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_9|也许就是因为这样，在领悟最终法则以后，虽然记忆力没有变好，但我感觉整个世界像一幅广阔的地图，在我眼前展开。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1127},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_10|我觉得这可能是在告诉我，除了在记忆中留下影子，世界也可以通过脚步去丈量。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1127},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_11|无法留住，就一直、一直向前，世界和你们都会替我记住的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_12|连我都忍不住热血起来了……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_13|我会成为最伟大的探险家，最厉害的机械大师，%player%，我想正式向你发出邀请。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1127},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_14|等到一切都解决了的那一天，请和我一起去探险吧，在这个世界里创造更多珍贵的记忆。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_15|或许这一天很远，也或许就在明天。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1127,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134202_Content_16|这个邀请永久有效，我一定会记住的。"
      })
    })
  },
  [134201] = {
    ID = 134201,
    CnID = "通讯@空想利刃最终法则",
    BaseSortID = 255,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 255,
        Trigger = 2,
        Ascription = 1131,
        Awaker = 15588,
        RequireTaskComplete = {134174},
        UnlockTime = 946674000,
        ContactRole = {1131},
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_1|守密人，我向教务处提交了申请，会缺席接下来三天的训练。",
        ExtraReward = {25218, 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Option_2|出什么事了？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_2|难道是材料有问题？你还好吗，需要帮助吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1131,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_3|不，恰恰相反，一切都很顺利，我有了一些和之前不同的提升。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_4|我有些没听明白……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_5|我……在离开军队之后，曾经游离了很长时间。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_6|我不知道自己应该为何而战，能够遵循的只有一件事，就是我甚至不知道最终是否能达成的正义。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_7|我希望自己能够站在弱者一方，站在无法发生的一方，站在被不平等对待的一方。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1131,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_8|但我也心知肚明，无论我变得有多强，总有我无能为力的事情，就像即使时间倒流，我依然无法阻止亚兰的消亡。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_9|艾尔瓦教官……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_10|但是，在我越过那条极限之后，我明白了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_11|什么？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Emoji = 46747
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_13|我即为先行者之刃，正是因为我始终走在这条路上，所以能够认识各位，认识你。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_14|我的追求令我永不孤单，或许我们永远无法抵达，但只要坚持下去，我可以令那个理想的、公平的世界，近一点，再近一点。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1131},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_15|以我身为刃，直到到达所有人都可以在光明中活着的乌托邦。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_16|好伟大的愿景，艾尔瓦教官，我会无条件支持你的！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1131,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_17|太好了，既然如此，我会用这三天，开发一套更加严苛和艰难的训练计划。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1131,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_18|你将是第一批试用它的人，请放心，我会全程跟随陪练，陪大家一起提升。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134201_Content_19|等下，这件事我觉得可以再商量商量……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Emoji = 46768
      })
    })
  },
