      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134249_Content_9|雷娅，你帮了我们很多，这是我应该做的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1142,
          nil,
          "Twinkie2"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134249_Content_10|呜……那种感觉又来了。我突然又热，又渴。胃里，在胃里面，"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1142,
          nil,
          "Twinkie1"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134249_Content_11|守密人，我是不是生病了？我的胃在发软，心脏也在发软，什么都是软的，我分不清，像要融化了一样……"
