      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1135},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_4|在跨向顶点，父神为我揭示这些难测的奥秘之前，我就已然将此身奉于这条道路。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1135},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_5|将众生的苦楚汇聚于一身，引领万物走向苦难不再存在的无垢净土——这并非重负。这是父神赐予我的恩典。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Option_6|但……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_6|我始终觉得你承受的实在太多了，他人的痛苦消解了，但代价……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_7|我的苍白之火，你拥有一颗柔软的心。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1135},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_8|然而请你放心。肉体的苦难于我，如同荆棘之于泥土，它刺入得越深，我便扎根得越稳。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1135},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_9|若此世尚有一人在受苦，祂必不是孤身一人。若有一人尚未脱离苦海，我绝不先于祂抵达彼岸。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_10|只要一想到这些，我内心的平和，就远超于肉身的苦楚。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Option_11|我明白了",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_11|我明白了，我可能没有那么伟大的想法。但就算是为了你，为了我的朋友。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_12|只要可以抵达那个理想的、安定的世界，不论是什么，我都会努力去做的。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_13|感谢你，苍白的使者。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_14|愿诸苦终有消解之日，愿你我始终并肩同行。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134264_Content_15|愿父神的庇佑，亦降临于你所珍视的一切之上。"
      })
    })
  },
