      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_3|没有，我还没睡。怎么了？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_4|在收到您的礼物后，我陷入沉睡，坠进了一个梦。我梦见了曾经那片大海，和疗养院外的夕阳。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_5|但是这一次……我没有走进海里。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_6|我站在岸边，看着那片海，它依然令我感到宁静，可我并不想向前。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Option_7|因为……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_7|如果这么猜测不会冒犯的话，是因为这一次，你有了想要留下来的理由吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_8|嗯。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_9|我曾经被痛苦压垮过，除了冲刷一切，容纳一切的海洋，没有什么能带走堵塞在我喉咙中的沉重。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_10|但您为我倾注的一切……在我体内汇聚成了一片新的湖泊。比那片大海还要更加广阔。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_11|祂告诉我：不必再害怕了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Option_12|宁菲亚……",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_12|我明白那种痛苦或许无法消解，但无论多少次，我都愿意把你拉向岸边。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_13|……如果爸爸和妈妈能听到您这句话，他们一定会很安心吧。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_14|我想……他们也许正在海的某处，看着现在的我。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_15|从今以后，我将运用所获得的这份力量，化作守护您的潮汐。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_16|或许，您会愿意再答应一个冒昧的请求吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Option_17|什么？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_17|什么？只要是我能做到的，我都很愿意。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1419},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_18|在天气放晴之后，请您与我去海边走走吧。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1419,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_19|我有太多话想要向您诉说，只要一个午后就好。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "20",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134279_Content_20|当然没问题，一定。"
      })
    })
