        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_4|很遗憾，我还不能真正显露出我的存在，不能离开黑池。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1054},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_5|但，我的精神、我的梦境、我注视着种种世界的视线，已然可以更多地存在，更多地传达于你。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1054},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_6|至少，你已经拥有了获得无穷知识的钥匙。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Option_7|无穷的知识？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_7|意思是不论我问什么，都能获得解答？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1054},
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_8|只要祂存在，抑或可被论证。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_9|嘿嘿，比如，我是说比如。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_10|什么微积分计算结果、通识课考试题目，以及诸如此类，也可以从无穷知识中直接获取吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_11|……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1054},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_12|你的确不再需要辛苦地记忆许多东西。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_13|但，我想，学习的意义便是求取知识的过程，以及思考力量的锻炼。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_14|你需先知晓你不知晓什么、应知晓什么，才能从无尽的宝库中找到你所需的那份答案。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Option_15|我明白了",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_15|好吧，我明白了。虽然和拉蒙娜的回答不一样，但果然还是一样的结局。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_16|我学，我学还不行吗！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134273_Content_17|很高兴看到你乐于求知的一面，加油。我会一如既往，陪伴在你身旁。"
      })
    })
  },
  [134268] = {
    ID = 134268,
    CnID = "通讯@杜勒赛因最终法则",
    BaseSortID = 273,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 273,
        Trigger = 2,
        Ascription = 1144,
        Awaker = 95786,
        RequireTaskComplete = {134146},
        UnlockTime = 946674000,
        ContactRole = {1144},
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        ChatID = "1",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_1|我最尊贵的客人，我该如何感谢你的慷慨？",
        ExtraReward = {25218, 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "2",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_2|你的馈赠让我已拥有了能真正稳固地守护葬骸城的力量。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_3|寻常的料理配不上你的赠予，我的珍藏又有些不合你的口味。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_4|真是让人幸福的苦恼啊。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_5|太客气了，杜勒赛因。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_6|我们一起经历过那么多，其实你不用纠结那些麻烦的客套往来。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_7|哦不不，这绝不是形式上的客套，我是在认真思考，如何筹备一场与密友的聚会。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_8|你已见过了葬骸城最特殊的舞会，要怎么令你与我们的关系再进一步，这确实是个难题。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Option_9|呃",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_9|呃……如果你想知道我的意愿，我朴素地希望它普通一点，不要有任何惊吓……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_10|原来如此，我明白了，你不想要那些庸俗的庆典，我也认为它们和你不相衬。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_11|我有个不错的主意，或许，你会愿意尝试和我一同到葬骸城外，接引一次临终者？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_12|假设我们拥有这种荣幸的话，希望你和我一同接引祂，令祂抵达祂的终点与新生，如何？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Option_13|我猜",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_13|虽然有点不合时宜……我猜最后应该还是会包含进食吧，毕竟这是葬骸城的风俗。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_14|唔，我不会将祂定义为进食，就和你已经知晓的那些故事一样。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1144},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_15|这只是一场最隆重、又最平静的告别。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_16|我很愿意参与，只要容许我跳过部分环节……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_17|当然，当然。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134268_Content_18|那么，葬骸城的马车和我，会于明早在门外等待你的到来。"
      })
    })
  },
  [134265] = {
    ID = 134265,
    CnID = "通讯@凯蒂古拉最终法则",
    BaseSortID = 274,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
