      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_3|小家伙，我真是越来越对你刮目相看了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_4|现在知道了？我厉害的地方还多着呢。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_5|哦？看来我们一群人一直把你当小家伙看待，还真是有点不合适了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1992},
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_6|嗯……以后，要开始叫你大家伙才行了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Option_7|？！",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_7|大家伙是什么东西啊！你又在一本正经逗我是吧？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Satire"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_8|哈哈哈，没办法，谁让每次出去喝酒你都是最先倒下的那个。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1992},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_9|让我只好次次把你抱回宿舍，给你脱鞋、盖被子、擦脸。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_10|你问问我的小弟们，他们认识我这么多年，什么时候看我做过这种事！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_11|唉呀，现在我的力量更猛烈了，下次还得小心别把你烫坏才行。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Option_12|原来是你？",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_12|什么……原来是你？那，有几次我的衣服被换掉了，也是你做的吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1992},
        ChatID = "13",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_13|是啊，你的衣服被酒和吃食弄脏了，总不能让你脏兮兮地进被窝。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "14",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_14|谢谢你，凯蒂古拉。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "15",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_15|但是下次能不能直接把我摇醒……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          1992,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "16",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_16|哟，害羞了？没关系，我俩什么关系。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1992},
        ChatID = "17",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_17|别说区区换衣服，就算是要我为你上刀山下火海，也完全不在话下！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1992},
        ChatID = "18",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_18|大不了，下次让你帮我换一次不就行了。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "19",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134265_Content_19|……哪里都不合理反而让人完全不知道该怎么回复呢！"
      })
    })
  },
  [134276] = {
