        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_2|一个流落在异世他乡的女孩子，收到一份昂贵的、能让她变强的礼物，这种事情你知道很像什么吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "3",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_3|在你说出什么区别于常人脑回路的话之前，我要先声明，你是弥萨格的一员，我们会互相帮助，这就是我把那些材料给你的原因。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "4",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_4|是吗，不是什么无聊的拐弯抹角的人类社会化前台行为？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "5",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_5|「回不去家了，好可怜啊，多关爱她一点吧。」"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        ChatID = "6",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_6|「一个人想办法好辛苦啊，给她一些助力吧。」，居然不是这种平凡社会会出现的高频理由吗？"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType4",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "7",
        MessageIntervals = 1,
        Option = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Option_7|首先",
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_7|首先，不管从哪个角度来看，茉夏你都和平凡这个词没什么关系吧！"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        ChatID = "8",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_8|哼☆哼，这个评价我倒是很喜欢。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "9",
        MessageIntervals = 2,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_9|其次，无论你对自己的认知是什么样，表面是什么样，对我而言，如你所说，「茉夏」就是「茉夏」。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        ChatID = "10",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_10|我不会同情你，不会居高临下地假设你的行为逻辑，我只希望你在这个世界玩得开心。"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "11",
        MessageIntervals = 0.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_11|……"
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = "DialogType1",
        TalkRole = {
          2202,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        ChatID = "12",
        MessageIntervals = 1.5,
        Content = "AvgCommunicate_134277_Content_12|哇哦，我们到底谁更疯狂一点啊，因为这种原因，就把这个级别的力量交给我这种疯子？"
